<title>USA: LeaRonal declares 3-for-2 stock split. [CORRECTED 18:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>LeaRonal declares 3-for-2 stock split. [CORRECTED 18:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, N.Y. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LeaRonal Inc said Tuesday it declared a 3-for-2 stock split in the form of a stock dividend to be distributed on August 19 to stockholders of record on July 29.</p>
<p>The company also said it would pay its quarterly cash dividend of $0.13 (corrects from $0.19) per share on August 19 to shareholders of record on July 29.</p>
<p>LeaRonal makes and sells specialty chemicals used in electronics and metal finishing.</p>
